          "source": "The MLX forward in read-data/mlx_decider_core.py derives from the captured MlxDecider source at ports/source-baselines/answer-questions-about-many-states/decide_in_batches_on_mlx.py.held. Source qualification and installed execution remain unproved. The existing package contributes the raw-weight loader, prompt/tokenizer owners and controller. The adapted gated-delta kernel retains the MLX-LM MIT notice; model weights retain their own terms."
